  "notes": [
   "The heading 'Music AA Requirement - complete 15 units' covers MUSC 2A, 2B, 3A, 3B (8 units) plus the Music Survey (3) and Piano Proficiency (4) blocks; stated left null on the first block since 15 spans all three.",
